WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.760
- The joke is out here, you know,

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.996
well this is where the wagon broke down

00:00:04.996 --> 00:00:08.395
and Dad didn't have enough
money to get us on west.

00:00:08.395 --> 00:00:10.557
- [Narrator] Four hours from anywhere,

00:00:10.557 --> 00:00:12.733
in the heart of America's bread basket,

00:00:12.733 --> 00:00:15.616
is a city fighting for better.

00:00:15.616 --> 00:00:18.949
(acoustic guitar music)

00:00:20.342 --> 00:00:22.046
To see the future of America,

00:00:22.046 --> 00:00:25.715
Modelo looks not to its
coast, but to its heart.

00:00:25.715 --> 00:00:28.093
It's there where we
found a place that proves

00:00:28.093 --> 00:00:29.651
it doesn't matter where you come from,

00:00:29.651 --> 00:00:32.234
it matters what you're made of.

00:00:38.251 --> 00:00:40.877
- The people out here have
an attitude of working.

00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:44.237
If you wanna work hard, this
is the area to do it in.

00:00:44.237 --> 00:00:46.282
I moved out here 30 years ago

00:00:46.282 --> 00:00:49.576
with not much more than
the shirt on my back.

00:00:49.576 --> 00:00:53.091
Then the families out here
took me and my family in.

00:00:53.091 --> 00:00:54.637
We're all transplants.

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:58.350
Everybody in Garden City's
from someplace else.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.035
- The reason why I came
to the United States

00:01:00.035 --> 00:01:02.292
is the violence back home.

00:01:02.292 --> 00:01:03.677
I was 13 years old, you know,

00:01:03.677 --> 00:01:05.972
and I seen a lot of bad stuff happening.

00:01:05.972 --> 00:01:07.997
I see people getting killed.

00:01:07.997 --> 00:01:11.664
You know, since the first day I
got here, I felt free.

00:01:16.912 --> 00:01:18.339
- I'm from Somalia.

00:01:18.339 --> 00:01:20.832
Back in my country, there was
a lot of civil war going on.

00:01:20.832 --> 00:01:25.832
You just go in the town and
you're scared to get hurt.

00:01:25.832 --> 00:01:28.904
You know I'm here, and I
decided to be here for my life,

00:01:28.904 --> 00:01:31.181
so I wanna have more
people, more communities,

00:01:31.181 --> 00:01:34.619
difference, you know, making big change to the city.

00:01:34.619 --> 00:01:36.617
I have still my family back in Somalia.

00:01:36.617 --> 00:01:38.621
I wanna have my family come with me.

00:01:38.621 --> 00:01:42.277
There's no way I can forget about them.

00:01:42.277 --> 00:01:45.386
- When you start with
no money, it is tough,

00:01:45.386 --> 00:01:47.616
to come to different town.

00:01:47.616 --> 00:01:49.499
You don't know what's going on.

00:01:49.499 --> 00:01:52.584
Sometimes it's gonna be
hard, but not impossible.

00:01:52.584 --> 00:01:54.141
Garden City is a good proof,

00:01:54.141 --> 00:01:58.120
the things you can do
to be a successful person.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.736
- Garden City is home.

00:01:59.736 --> 00:02:01.755
It doesn't matter who you
are or where you come from,

00:02:01.755 --> 00:02:03.275
the doors are open.

00:02:03.275 --> 00:02:06.942
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:11.259 --> 00:02:14.344
- People are people, we all
have the same wants and needs.

00:02:14.344 --> 00:02:16.859
Garden City is constantly
fighting for better,

00:02:16.859 --> 00:02:19.459
and I think if people just can see

00:02:19.459 --> 00:02:23.076
that we're all just trying
to make it in this world.

00:02:23.076 --> 00:02:26.326
It's just a lot easier to be accepting.

00:02:31.573 --> 00:02:34.176
(speaking foreign language)

00:02:34.176 --> 00:02:36.605
(cheering)

00:02:36.605 --> 00:02:39.605
(Latin party music)

00:02:47.821 --> 00:02:50.404
(ambient tone)

